OL,3,APolice officers sacked for 'despicable'
OL,4,Aon-duty filming of vulnerable people
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo male Police Service of Northern
OL,7,FIreland (PSNI) officers have been
OL,8,Fsacked for taking videos and photos of
OL,9,F18 vulnerable people they had been sent
OL,10,Fto help.
OL,12,FIn one video, a woman with learning
OL,13,Fdifficulties was filmed in bed and
OL,14,Fasked about her sex life.
OL,16,FThe two officers, identified as
OL,17,FOfficers A and B, had been tasked to
OL,18,Fher house in 2021 after a report of
OL,19,Fconcern for her safety.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
