OL,3,APolice officers sacked for 'despicable'
OL,4,Aon-duty filming of vulnerable people
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Ombudsman Jacqui Durkin said
OL,7,Ftheir behaviour had been "utterly
OL,8,Fdespicable".
